* Example 08: the NMOS sink array at its DC operating point (out at 1.8 V, vb
* at 1.0 V), every source held at DC over a short transient (EM's currents come
* from a .tran). run.sh writes
* tb_op_rcc.cir from this file, as tb_tran.cir.in.
.param mc_mm_switch=0 mc_pr_switch=0
.include "@PDK_ROOT@/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/corners/tt.spice"
.include "@PDK_ROOT@/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/r+c/res_typical__cap_typical.spice"
.include "@NETLIST@"

Vout out 0 1.8
Vvss vss 0 0
Vvb vb 0 1.0
Xdut vb out vss sink
.options timeint reltol=1e-4
* (every source at DC: run.sh's --period 1e-9 averages the last three 1 ns
* spans of the 4 ns record; a step no longer than 20 ps)
.tran 0.01n 4n 0 0.02n
.end
